  "answer": "**Plant Swap at the Courtyard!**\n\nGot a cutting that's taking over your windowsill, or a seedling that needs a new home? Come swap plants with your neighbors.\n\n**When:** Saturday, 21 November, 11:00 to 14:00\n**Where:** Courtyard of the Linden Street community house\n\nBring cuttings, seedlings or pots, and label each one with the plant's name so everyone knows what they're taking home. Any plants left over at the end will go to the school garden, so nothing goes to waste.\n\nQuestions? Ask Tobias Wren, flat 3B.\n\nHope to see you there, green thumbs and beginners alike!"
